sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to send a ReserveNowRequest<br>with a groupIdToken for a specific EVSE

    CSMS->>CS: ReserveNowRequest (evseId, idToken, groupIdToken)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be <Configured evseId><br>connectorType must be omitted<br>groupIdToken must be provided<br>idToken.idToken <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken><br>idToken.type <Configured valid_idtoken_type>

    CS-->>CSMS: ReserveNowResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 3: Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state<br>of the connector(s) of the configured EVSE
    CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Reserved)
    CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Reserved", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
